{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/extras/05969cd5895f220e10d87ee01f5d0edc.avif?t=1755511411\" data-has-big width=1600 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Roguelite Puzzle Game That Reinvents a Timeless Formula</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if falling blocks met a jump button and a rebellion? <br><strong>Gunny Ascend</strong> transforms the classic block-stacking puzzle formula into a fast-paced, genre-bending experience. Blending roguelite progression, adaptive platforming, and a dimension-hopping story full of chaos, charm, and surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/extras/8bb1ee515543c81048aa01491f70adaf.poster.avif?t=1755511411\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/extras/8bb1ee515543c81048aa01491f70adaf.webm?t=1755511411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/extras/8bb1ee515543c81048aa01491f70adaf.mp4?t=1755511411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS DEMO:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into the action with this special demo of <strong>Gunny Ascend</strong> and get a hands-on preview of its chaotic roguelite gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a condensed version of <i>World 1</i> from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>4 frantic levels</strong> packed with hazards, tricky jumps, and relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the first boss, <strong>Miasmo</strong>, in an intense showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the starting character and experiment with a small set of core abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s in the Full Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple themed worlds, each with unique enemies, hazards, and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full roster of playable characters, each with their own skills and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded progression systems, unlockable abilities, and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More secrets, challenges, and replayability than ever.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840730?t=1755511411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/44600980ffdef9752096cc15149a7a2da020b7c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755511411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/c1b1960730ad89ffb8a0f57b5c87063947237b14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755511411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/c1b1960730ad89ffb8a0f57b5c87063947237b14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755511411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840730/extras/05969cd5895f220e10d87ee01f5d0edc.avif?t=1755511411\" data-has-big width=1600 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Roguelite Pu